Subject: [PATCH] Show the camera folder in All Photos

The app was the Enyo template: the photo grid only added placeholder text, so
no photo ever showed. Ask for read access to images, list the DCIM folder through
the file manager service, show the camera thumbnails, open a photo full size on
tap, and let "All Photos & Videos" open the grid.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff --git a/source/data/data.js b/source/data/data.js
index f660502..22d089b 100644
--- a/source/data/data.js
+++ b/source/data/data.js
@@ -1,5 +1,99 @@
 /**
-	For simple applications, you might define all of your models, collections,
